cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use StudyAlign in your research, please cite the paper below."
title: StudyAlign
abstract: >-
  StudyAlign is an open-source software system for setting up web-based user
  studies to evaluate functional interactive prototypes, including prototypes
  with AI features. It supports experiment procedures, counterbalancing,
  external questionnaire integration, participant flow, and interaction logging,
  with a focus on Human-Computer Interaction and human-AI interaction research.
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/StudyAlign/study-align"
